  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=X&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">儲存之袋（Bag Of Holding）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 為《我的世界》增添了充滿魔力的便攜式儲物空間。將您的財寶裝入時尚的袋子中，隨時隨地輕鬆存取，減少與雜亂背包抗爭的時間。🎒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提供三種等級的袋子供您選擇，容量依次遞增，從小巧的皮製錢包到能容納整座建築材料的巨大金袋皆可滿足需求。您可以直接從快捷欄打開袋子，或在背包介面中無縫操作。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">受現代捆綁機制啟發，本模組允許您瀏覽內容、放入物品、精確取出所需物品，並管理儲物空間，無需頻繁開啟獨立選單。強大的工具提示預覽與直覺的操作控制，讓每個袋子都使用快速且方便。🎯</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">對於重視財物的冒險者而言，袋子甚至可以附魔 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保存（Preservation）</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 附魔，使其在死亡時得以倖存，代價是消耗附魔等級。💎</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">三種袋子等級：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作皮革、鐵與金製袋子，容量逐漸增加以符合您的需求。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">基於背包的存取功能：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 無需開啟專用介面，即可直接向袋子內放入或取出物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">詳細內容預覽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 直接在物品工具提示中查看已儲存的內容，讓您一眼就能掌握每個袋子的物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">選擇任意已存物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用滑鼠滾輪或鍵盤方向鍵，精確選擇您想要操作的已存物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">已選物品詳情：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 瀏覽袋子內容時，即時顯示目前所選物品的資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速物品轉移：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 透過直覺的背包操作，快速放入或取出物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跨多格拖曳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 點擊並拖曳跨越多個背包欄位，批量放入或取出物品，大幅提升管理效率。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精確物品移動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 按住 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Control</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Mac 為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）可移動單一物品而非整組，並精確控制轉移數量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">智慧相容性指示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 視覺提示會顯示手中物品能否放入，以及內部是否已有相符物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">專屬袋子介面：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 需要傳統儲物畫面時，可直接從快捷欄開啟袋子。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保存附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 為袋子附魔「保存」，防止其在死亡時遺失。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">高度可設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自訂儲存容量、互動方式、操作控制、工具提示行為與視覺效果，以符合您的遊玩風格。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC 與 NEOFORGE 版本）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC 版本）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC 版本）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援設定，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行調整（於 Fabric 版本需安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若需使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾內，檔名依設定類型分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有模組都會包含所有類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">RWTema</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 啟發此模組，靈感來自其早期版本的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Extra Utilities</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組中的「儲存之袋」道具。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nyffuuuh23\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Nyffuuuh23</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作了這些精美的紋理！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/magnum-torch\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
